\enumerate{
\item \strong{Single active fleet}: \code{stats::optimize()} over the log-scale
multiplier, with an automatic bracket search that detects whether the
TAC is achievable within \code{maxEffort}.
\item \strong{Multiple active fleets}: an informed proportional rescale of the
