full-Jacobian fallback, each step protected by a backtracking line
search (see below). Effort values are clamped to \verb{[minEffort, maxEffort]} throughout to prevent divergence when biomass is low.
\item \strong{\code{stats::optim()} (BFGS) fallback}: attempted whenever Newton-Raphson
does not converge, unless the reason is a genuine effort ceiling
